    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my teenage son was just diagnosed with anemia and his doctor said he needs iron supplements. i bought these 325mg pills but i'm worried they'll take too long to work. if i give him two of them at once instead of just one, will that help get his levels up faster?",
