      "content": "Taking two 325mg iron capsules at once is generally too high a dose for a teenager and may cause severe gastrointestinal side effects or toxicity. Iron supplements are best absorbed at a moderate dose (typically 60mg to 120mg of elemental iron) spread out over the day, not taken in a single large amount. You should definitely consult your doctor or pharmacist to confirm the correct dosage for his specific needs and to ensure the safety and effectiveness of the treatment.",
