    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but he's already so tired all the time, i just want him to feel better soon. he's a big kid, like 150lbs, so i figured more iron would just be better for him since he's lacking it so much. isn't it true that for a deficiency you just need to replenish the stores quickly? it's just a vitamin, right?",
