      "content": "i get that, but i really don't want to keep calling the doctor every time i have a question. if he takes the 650mg dose just for a few days to kickstart things, it should be fine, right? it's not like he's a little kid, he's a grown boy. can't we just do a high dose for 3 days then go back to the normal amount?",
